# Smart Helmet Alcohol Detection System

A safety-focused smart helmet prototype developed using Arduino and alcohol sensors to detect alcohol presence in rider breath and simulate ignition prevention.

## Features
- Alcohol detection using MQ sensor
- Arduino-based control system
- Ignition lock simulation
- Safety-oriented embedded prototype

## Components Used
- Arduino Uno
- MQ Alcohol Sensor
- LEDs
- Breadboard
- Jumper wires

## My Contribution
- Sensor integration
- Prototype setup
- Testing and demonstration

